  &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;🎨&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/192429/rss" title="colorsym.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;ColorSym: Symbols to Identify Colors 'When Color Alone Isn't Enough'&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — A way to use symbols to supplement colors, aiding with accessibility. The symbols are 'intelligent' where, for example, the orange symbol is a combo of those for red and yellow. Available as SVGs or a custom font.&lt;/p&gt;
