&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everyone's Interop 2027 Wishlists&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Last week we shared that you can now &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191779/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;rank the Interop web platform proposals for 2027&lt;/a&gt;. Since then, plenty of folks have shared their own rankings and explained their choices:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⭐ &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191780/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Josh Comeau's &lt;em&gt;The Future of CSS&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; – Josh's top ten, from CSS functions and &lt;code&gt;corner-shape&lt;/code&gt; to anchored container queries and scroll-triggered animations, each with live demos, current browser support, and tips you can use today. A particularly good place to start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔎 &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191782/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Sara Soueidan's picks&lt;/a&gt; put accessibility first. It's a privilege, she notes, that we get to influence what browser makers work on. &lt;code&gt;focusgroup&lt;/code&gt; is her top pick.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✏️ &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191783/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Declan Chidlow's 13 features&lt;/a&gt; – SVG improvements on top, followed by the CSS &lt;code&gt;reading-flow&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;reading-order&lt;/code&gt; properties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📝 More picks from &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191784/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Stuart Robson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191785/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Eric Meyer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191786/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Ana Rodrigues&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191787/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Tyler Sticka&lt;/a&gt;, and 🦋 &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191788/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;this Bluesky thread&lt;/a&gt; has even more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired to submit your own? &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191789/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Rank about ten proposals you'd like to see prioritized&lt;/a&gt;. The Firefox team says that's enough to provide useful input.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div style="   margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;  "&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
